  "body": "## Lexiduo v0.0.2\n\nContext-aware, AI-powered dual subtitle translator and language learning ecosystem for Android.\n\n### Highlights\n- 📺 Polymorphic Dual-Mode Player (YouTube and local video)\n- 🪟 Synchronized YouTube Floating Overlay capsule with ad break freeze\n- 🧠 Context-aware translation powered by Google Gemini AI\n- 📖 Interactive word lookup, phonetics, and native audio pronunciation\n- 🌍 35+ global languages with full RTL support\n- 🛡️ 100% Free and Open Source under GNU General Public License v3.0 (GPLv3)\n\n### Artifacts\n- **Android APK**: `app-release.apk` (Signed Release, Package ID: `com.lexiduo.app`)"
